# Check out every text file with LF, even on Windows (overrides core.autocrlf).
# Prettier enforces endOfLine "lf", so CRLF working-tree files fail
# `npm run format:check` locally while CI (Linux, LF checkout) passes —
# the 2026-07-21 "14 unformatted files" false alarm. All repo content is
# stored LF; this only pins what checkout writes.
* text=auto eol=lf
